      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-194983\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-194983\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>Chimney connectors for low-heat appliances shall be of sheet steel pipe having resistance to corrosion and heat not less than that of galvanized steel specified in <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-194982', hash: '#JD_MCTable803.9(1)' }}\">Table 803.9(1)<\/Link>. Connectors for medium-heat appliances and high-heat appliances shall be of sheet steel not less than the thickness specified in <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-194982', hash: '#JD_MCTable803.9(2)' }}\">Table 803.9(2)<\/Link>.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-194984\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-194984\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><a name=\"JD_MCTable803.9(1)\" id=\"JD_MCTable803.9(1)\" title=\"MC Table 803.9(1)\"><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Table 803.9(1)<br><\/br>Minimum Chimney Connector Thickness for Low-Heat Appliances<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-194985\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-194985\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div style=\"margin-bottom=10pt\">&#160;<div class=\"xsl-table\">",
